id: pm-ts-starter-1m0w
title: Preserve published dependencies in item-covered changelog windows
description: "Review follow-up: published tag v2026.11.10 includes dependency PRs 206, 203, 201, 200, 199 that default tracker regeneration omits when the release window contains closed items. The pinned generator only enriches such windows when dependency-updates is enabled. Updating package scripts or generator behavior is outside this tracker-only synchronization."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 3
tags[3]: changelog,"gh:unbraind/pm-ts-starter#211",maintenance
created_at: "2026-11-16T15:23:01.087Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-23T16:27:31.812Z"
author: codex-sol
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: Regeneration preserves the published dependency PR entries alongside tracker notes and the unchanged changelog check passes; implementation receives its own source review.
comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-16T15:23:05.793Z",codex-sol,"Verified the unresolved dependency-note review against published tag v2026.11.10: dependency PRs 206, 203, 201, 200, 199 are present there. The configured changelog:full omits --dependency-updates; the pinned generator enriches item-covered windows only with that option. A persistent fix requires package-script or generator changes, outside the authorized tracker/changelog scope. Reused this follow-up; no review reply or resolution was sent."
  "2026-11-23T09:52:04.047Z",codex-agent,"Closure follow-up: changelog dependency updates. Verify against current main and the existing PR head before recording the result."
  "2026-11-23T09:53:10.198Z",codex-agent,The closure verifier allows tracker files and CHANGELOG.md only. This follow-up explicitly calls for package.json flags so the verifier will still report the manifest as out of scope.
  "2026-11-23T09:57:09.786Z",codex-agent,"Package changelog generation, verification and release notes use --dependency-updates, including checks that delegate to the full generator. With the same tracker and fetched tags, running the original manifest omitted the published dependency bullets for #199, #200, #201, #203, #206. The flag restored all of them. Changelog byte check and release notes rendering passed."
  "2026-11-23T10:07:59.461Z",codex-agent,"Linked Node tests passed 43/43 with no skips, and the changelog check passed. Final verification will use the committed branch. CI checks for the closure follow-up are tracked at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ts-starter/pull/211/checks."
  "2026-11-23T16:12:55.218Z",codex-agent,The dependency-note switch belongs in fix/changelog-keep-dependency-updates. Restore this closure branch's package scripts to main and regenerate with the unflagged invocation. The flag PR will restore the dependency notes separately.
  "2026-11-23T16:17:39.103Z",codex-agent,"The registered focused Node tests and changelog check passed. Identity, public-content and history prefix checks are part of the final-head gate. The full release gate runs in package CI."
  "2026-11-23T16:22:21.037Z",codex-agent,"Use the opt-in in every package changelog invocation, including delegated verification. The same-tag comparison and generated release headings verify the previously published dependency PRs: 199,200,201,203,206."
  "2026-11-23T16:27:29.690Z",codex-agent,"The linked release notes command, direct release notes and package identity test passed. With the flag enabled, the generated ledger contains all identified published dependency PRs at their release headings. Changelog verification is repeated after this tracker update."
